{
  "version": 1,
  "readme": "Manual slot mapping for templates exported from Affinity Designer without slot: layer names. A template whose layers are named slot:<name> needs no slots array here - the app discovers them. 'texts' holds indices into the template's <text> elements in document order (see tools/check-manifest.py). 'image' holds the id of the <image> in <defs> whose href gets replaced.",
